I sit at my desk in the office.
I write code on my computer.
I look out the window.
It is very bad weather today.
The sky is dark and heavy.
It is completely gray outside.
It rains constantly against the glass.
It is also blowing a lot.
I look at the clock on the wall.
It is only early afternoon.
But it becomes gloomy very quickly.
The light disappears into the gray sky.
It becomes dark early in this season.
It is a typical winter afternoon in Denmark.
It is very cold out there in the wind.
But it is nicely warm in here.
I drink some hot coffee from my cup.
I listen to the rain for a minute.
Then I look at my computer screen again.
I continue with my code.
